  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\n(First number × 7) - 8\n\n1) 23 : 153 → (23 × 7) - 8 = 161 - 8 = 153\n\n2) 15 : 97 → (15 × 7) - 8 = 105 - 8 = 97\n\n**3) 16 : 106 → (16 × 7) - 8 = 112 - 8 = 104 ****≠ 106**.\n\n4) 26 : 174 → (26 × 7) - 8 = 182 - 8 = 174\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"16 : 106\".**",
